cff-version: 1.2.0

message:
  If you use CAPRI-MOD in scientific research, academic
  publications, technical reports, or derivative software,
  please cite CAPRI-MOD and identify the version used.

type: software

title:
  CAPRI-MOD: Python Implementation of the
  CAPRI Agricultural Economic Model

authors:
  - family-names: Ghirimoldi
    given-names: Gabriele

repository-code: https://github.com/nuvolaTeam/CAPRI-MOD

url: https://github.com/nuvolaTeam/CAPRI-MOD

abstract:
  CAPRI-MOD is an experimental Python implementation
  of the Common Agricultural Policy Regionalised
  Impact (CAPRI) modelling framework, supporting
  transparent and reproducible agricultural economic
  modelling and policy scenario analysis.

keywords:
  - CAPRI
  - CAPRI-MOD
  - agricultural economics
  - economic modelling
  - agricultural policy
  - Python
  - scenario analysis

version: 0.1.0

license: GPL-3.0-only

references:
  - type: software
    title: CAPRI modelling system
    authors:
      - given-names: University of Bonn and partner institutions (CAPRI network)
    url: https://www.capri-model.org
    notes:
      The original CAPRI model, developed at the University of Bonn and
      partner institutions. CAPRI-MOD is an independent reimplementation,
      not a release of the CAPRI modelling system.
